#: src/components/SettingsSheet.tsx:171
msgid "Grove is not a records race. No hint leaves, no counts, no completeness meters — a scanned letter is a treasure your grandmother touched, never \"1 source attached.\" People still living get minimal entries by default; they fill in their own story when they join."
msgstr "Grove is not a records race. No hint leaves, no counts, no completeness meters — a scanned letter is a treasure your grandmother touched, never \"1 source attached.\" People still living get minimal entries by default; they fill in their own story when they join."

