#: src/components/SettingsSheet.tsx:178
msgid "The trade: your passphrase never leaves this device, so there's no reset by email — that button would mean someone else could read the tree. Two ways back in live in Sync: a printed recovery kit (a one-page code for a fire safe), or Guardians — a few people you trust, jointly. Keep the passphrase somewhere safe as well."
msgstr "The trade: your passphrase never leaves this device, so there's no reset by email — that button would mean someone else could read the tree. Two ways back in live in Sync: a printed recovery kit (a one-page code for a fire safe), or Guardians — a few people you trust, jointly. Keep the passphrase somewhere safe as well."

